{"id":"16df0c25397b1f80","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-strong-inference-size.md","title":"Buss强推理次数与原子初始证明域","display":"df-strong-inference-size — Buss强推理次数与原子初始证明域","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-strong-inference-size","aliases":["72-df-strong-inference-size"],"display":"df-strong-inference-size — Buss强推理次数与原子初始证明域","depends_on":["[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.5, print13/PDF25; §2.3.2–2.3.3, print32/PDF44; local alpha-explicit representation","source_kind":"source-driven-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_23":"在参数节显式登记源定理所用的含切/无切演算签名"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-strong-inference-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-strong-inference-size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-inference-size — Buss强推理次数与原子初始证明域"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.5, print13/PDF25; §2.3.2–2.3.3, print32/PDF44; local alpha-explicit representation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-driven-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"在参数节显式登记源定理所用的含切/无切演算签名"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是现行纯逻辑 LK/LJ 的含Cut或无Cut版本。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}(q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}(q)\\)</span> 为相继式两侧公式的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tag}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tag}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rule}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rule}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取既有定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BussSize}\">\\(\\operatorname{BussSize}\\)</span> 数逻辑规则和Cut，不数初始式、六类弱结构规则及表示绑定改名的 AL/AR。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Sigma,\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Sigma,\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是下式指定的原子初始、无真假常元的源定理适用证明域，不预先假定存在消切算法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 均为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a> 的实际三元组，不另改变规则或公理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Strong}(\\pi)&amp;:=\\{u\\in D:\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi(u)\\ne\\mathsf{ax}\\land\n\\operatorname{Rule}_\\pi(u)\\notin\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{BussSize}(\\pi)&amp;:=|\\operatorname{Strong}(\\pi)|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{AtomicInitial}(\\pi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in D\\ (\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi(u)=\\mathsf{ax}\\Rightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\ (\\ell(u)=(\\langle P\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle P\\rangle))),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TruthConstantFree}(\\pi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}(\\ell(u))\\\n\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(A)\\cap\\{\\top,\\bot\\}=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal B_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{AtomicInitial}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{TruthConstantFree}(\\pi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{AtomicInitial}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{TruthConstantFree}(\\pi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Strong}(\\pi)&amp;:=\\{u\\in D:\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi(u)\\ne\\mathsf{ax}\\land\n\\operatorname{Rule}_\\pi(u)\\notin\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{BussSize}(\\pi)&amp;:=|\\operatorname{Strong}(\\pi)|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{AtomicInitial}(\\pi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in D\\ (\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi(u)=\\mathsf{ax}\\Rightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\ (\\ell(u)=(\\langle P\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle P\\rangle))),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TruthConstantFree}(\\pi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}(\\ell(u))\\\n\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(A)\\cap\\{\\top,\\bot\\}=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal B_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{AtomicInitial}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{TruthConstantFree}(\\pi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{AtomicInitial}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{TruthConstantFree}(\\pi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 I§1.2.5（印刷13/PDF25）及 §2.3.2（印刷32/PDF44）的大小是强推理次数，原子初始式不计。有限 D 保证基数是自然数。局部α步骤只改变绑定名，规整到原书两类变量时不产生强推理，故计数为0；它不是书中新增加的逻辑推理。</p>\n<p>原有 len 数全部节点，size 数编码位，三者不可直接混用。源原子初始条件也不可省略：本地允许任意公式恒等初始式，将复杂恒等式先展开为原子初始证明会增加强推理次数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 精确声明采用哪一种域；它保留原书语言的所有联结词和量词，不以“假定存在总消切算法”作为前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","ta