bot\\}=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal B_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{AtomicInitial}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{TruthConstantFree}(\\pi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{AtomicInitial}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{TruthConstantFree}(\\pi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false}],"bytes":3447,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"59f9df438acba46e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"源定理分支中 $\\pi\\in\\mathcal B_\\Sigma$，$d\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)\\le d+1$；$\\operatorname{BussSize}$、$\\mathcal B_\\Sigma,\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-strong-inference-size]]。$\\operatorname{Tow}:\\omega^2\\to\\omega$ 由下式自然数递归引入。该分支与原有编码参数 $E,d_E:E\\to\\omega$ 分开：后者的函数切度现记 $d_E$，不能与自然数 d 混作同一输入。"}],"outgoing":["c60a11e47ac58326","81c9c855e009a6d4","3c073b947b255638","f9452e4a7788a117"]}